{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんみさみさ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせ、みさ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(後ろ さゆりん、まいまい)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ明日！\n全国握手会〜っ！いぇいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださるみなさん。\n心の準備はできてますかっ \\(//∇//)\\ ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達はできています！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、盛り上がって盛り上がって\n燃え尽きてね？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさは早くみなさんに会いたくて\nステージに立ちたくて\nパフォーマンスをしたくて\nもう、明日が楽しみすぎて\n今日なかなか寝れないよ〜〜(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとお布団の中に\n入ってるんやけどさ〜〜(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く寝なきゃなのは\n十分分かっちょんのやけどさ〜(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと何時間後には\nみなさんとお会いできるので\n我慢して、早く寝るとします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日晴れるといいなぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし、雨が降っても 私達のパワーで\nそんなのへっちゃら！\nにしてやるっ\\(//∇//)\\"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のペアは\nゆったんちゃんです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ〜〜ゆったんから\nお尻触られないかなあああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなあああ（ ;  ; ）\n明日はみさのお尻狙われるよー涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。笑\n笑顔100％で待っていますので\nぜひ握手しましょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージでのパフォーマンスも\n期待していてください！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼ 質問返し ▼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みさみさのこと推していい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ（；゜０゜）\nぜんっぜんいいに決まっちょん！\n嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただし条件があります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一回好きになったら\nずっと好きでいなきゃいけない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだけだよ？守れる？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・髪の毛ショートにしたことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩くらいのボブっぽいのは\nしたことあるんやけど\n生駒っちや市来ちゃんみたいな\ntheショート！って感じは\nしたことないな〜\nきっとtheショートは\nみさは似合わないよ〜〜（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも質問あったら\nいろいろしてくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして最後に今日のこと書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン前に時間があったので\nまいやんと買い物に行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんはねー\n買うものちゃちゃっと決めれるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄いよー感心する（ ;  ; ）\nみさ服の買い物は\nなかなか決めれなくて\nめっちゃ優柔不断になるけん\n羨ましいよー(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして美容院にも行って\nトリートメントと前髪カット\nしてもらいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり変わってないんやけど.....\nみさをよく見ている方にはすぐ\n分かるかもねっ\\(//∇//)\\"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いてくれたら嬉しいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは明日は\n読売ランドで待ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の画像はななみんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみさみさくらんぼ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/03/0621211/0001.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}